5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since it's the first day, we don't have any information yet. Let's start by getting a feel for everyone's behavior. Does anyone have any initial thoughts?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm just so excited to play! I wonder who the big bad wolf is? Maybe it's someone who looks way too calm!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Mizuki. We should observe carefully. Sakura, being overly excited can sometimes be a mask, but for now, it's too early to draw conclusions.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll just listen for now. It's better to be patient and see how the conversation unfolds naturally.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with Sakura! This is going to be so much fun. I'll help find the wolf, even if I'm a bit clumsy!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have two very energetic players and two very quiet ones. Jonathan, you're being very reserved. Is that just your nature, or are you hiding something?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe he's just shy! Or maybe he's thinking of a super secret plan to catch the wolf! Right, Jonathan?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Let's not jump to conclusions. Silence can be a sign of caution or simply a personality trait. We need more concrete patterns before we start accusing people.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is simply my nature. I find that listening allows me to understand the situation more clearly than speaking.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"That makes sense! I'm the opposite, I just can't stop talking when I'm excited! But I'm watching everyone very closely!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we're just observing, I'll keep an eye on the balance of the group. The wolf will likely try to blend in or deflect suspicion. Does anyone feel like someone is acting out of character?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, maybe Toshio is being a little too serious? He's like a detective in a movie! But that's also kind of cool, isn't it?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"I am simply trying to maintain a logical approach. If we let our emotions or impressions lead us, we might accidentally execute an innocent villager.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Toshio is right. A hasty decision based on a feeling could be a fatal mistake for the village.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I agree! We have to be super careful. But I'm still going to keep guessing because that's the best part of the game!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have no clues yet, let's just keep this atmosphere for now. I'll be watching everyone's reactions tomorrow once the first night's events are revealed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I can't wait for tomorrow! I hope the Seer finds something super juicy tonight! Good luck everyone, and sleep tight!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"Let's hope for a clear result from the divination. Until then, we should all remain vigilant. Good night.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Good night. I hope we all wake up to a peaceful morning.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Me too! Sweet dreams, everyone! I'll be dreaming of catching that wolf!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
