31,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning, everyone. Since it's Day 1, we need to be more focused. Did anyone notice anything strange, or does the Seer have any information they're willing to share?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm still wide awake! I wonder if the Seer found a clue? Come on, if you know something, tell us! It'll be so exciting!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I have information. I divined Kenji last night, and the result was clear: Kenji is the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a very bold and direct claim. Toshio, are you certain you are the Seer, or could this be a strategy to frame Kenji?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! No way! Toshio, why are you lying? I'm not the werewolf! I'm just a regular guy! You can't just say that and expect us to believe you!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio, you've come forward very quickly. While your confidence is convincing, we must consider if a werewolf would claim to be the Seer to eliminate a villager immediately. Kenji, your reaction is quite emotional.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, Kenji looks so sad! Are you sure, Toshio? I mean, it would be a huge twist, but Kenji is too nice to be a scary wolf, right?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"My result is absolute. I have no reason to lie, as doing so would only make me a target once the real Seer speaks. Kenji's emotional reaction is a common tactic to gain sympathy.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Toshio is indeed the Seer, the game ends today. However, if he is the werewolf, he has just identified his target. We must weigh the risk of losing a villager against the chance of winning immediately.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not using a tactic! I'm just shocked! Please, everyone, don't listen to him! If you vote for me, the real wolf is still out there and we'll lose!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we execute Kenji and he is the werewolf, we win. If he is a villager, we lose a valuable member. However, Toshio's claim is very specific. Sakura, you seem hesitant; what do you think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I don't know! I want to believe Kenji, but Toshio sounds so sure of himself. It's like a real mystery! If we're wrong, I'll feel super bad, but we have to find the wolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is far greater than the risk of trusting the Seer. If you hesitate now, the werewolf will simply kill another one of us tonight.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Toshio's logic is sound, but the danger of a fake Seer is real. However, if we don't act on this information, we are essentially giving the werewolf another night to attack.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not the wolf! Please, look at me! I've been nothing but friendly! Toshio is just trying to trick you all into killing an innocent person! Don't do it!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It's time to decide. Toshio's claim is direct, and while Kenji's plea is heartfelt, the logic of the Seer's role suggests we should act. I'm leaning toward voting for Kenji to end this now.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'll go with the group! I'm sorry, Kenji, but if Toshio is really the Seer, we have to do this! I hope I'm not making a mistake!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"The evidence is clear. I am the Seer, and Kenji is the werewolf. Let us end this game now before any more of us are put in danger.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe the most logical course of action is to trust Toshio's divination. While the risk exists, the potential reward of ending the game immediately outweighs the uncertainty. I will vote for Kenji.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"This is so unfair! You're all just going to believe him over me? Please, just one more day! I'm not the wolf, I promise! You're making a huge mistake!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
